---
/**
 * The site footer (#91): a generic copyright, set in the editorial face on
 * the editorial ground. Replaces the home slab's "Status: open to full time
 * roles + freelance" and "# brohde.com" lines.
 *
 * BaseLayout renders this outside .screen, so it is the page's single
 * contentinfo landmark and is identical across page types. /chat opts out
 * via footer={false}: it is the full-window slab, with no editorial ground.
 *
 * The year is literal on purpose (Brian's exact string). Deriving it from the
 * build date would self-maintain, but that is his call to make, not ours.
 */
---

<footer class="sfoot">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p>&copy; 2026 Brian Rohde</p>
  </div>
</footer>
